  m_Name: PolandQuestion11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HowX.Data.QuestionData
  text:
    en: What is the most Polish topping to put on pizza?
    native: Jaki jest najbardziej polski dodatek do pizzy?
  visual: {fileID: 0}
  useImageAnswers: 0
  answers:
  - text:
      en: Pineapple
      native: Ananas
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Garlic Sauce
      native: Sos czosnkowy
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 1
  - text:
      en: Pepperoni
      native: Pepperoni
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Olive Oil
      native: Oliwa
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  explanation:
    en: In Italy, they use olive oil. In Poland, we drown the pizza in thick, white
      garlic sauce. It is the law.
    native: "We W\u0142oszech u\u017Cywaj\u0105 oliwy. W Polsce topimy pizz\u0119
      w g\u0119stym, bia\u0142ym sosie czosnkowym. Takie jest prawo."
